@ Index:   Problem 12a, starting rate 55
@ Author:  Jaco Mostert, fm Duncan Murray's problem set
@ Same as P12, starting rate 55.
LBL ‘P12a’
  # Problem 12 first do I/a then FV
  40
  STO ‘NPPER’
  900
  STO ‘PV’
  -400
  STO ‘PMT’
  -1000
  STO ‘FV’
  1
  STO ‘PPER/a’
  STO ‘CPER/a’
  BeginP
  55
  STO ‘I%/a’
  I/a
  FV
  END
.END.
